ent_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411442006:1":{"text":"だ、だめです！だめだめ！ぜってーにダメです！！","source_cn":"不、不行！绝对不行！绝对绝对绝对不行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C314AA495DE9F61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1411442007:1":{"text":"クルスタ様の爆弾は、彼女が命じれば百パー爆発するんです！","source_cn":"库露丝塔大人的炸弹只要她愿意，就绝对会炸掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5134153132E6292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1411442008:1":{"text":"なんであの時、斬られた爆弾がすぐに爆発しなかったか、分かってんですか！？あれは――","source_cn":"你们不知道为什么那个炸弹被斩碎却没爆炸吗？是因为——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x599B61F788616670","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1411442009:1":{"text":"あれは、正面にいたクルスタを、聖剣が最初に斬ったからでしょう。","source_cn":"因为那把圣剑，事实上最先斩碎的是正面迎击的库露丝塔本人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF01DF2D6A38F86B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1411442010:1":{"text":"制御を失った爆弾は爆発できずに斬られてしまった。だから予想よりも威力が小さかったんです。","source_cn":"失去主人存在操控的炸弹无法被即时引爆，只能被同样斩碎，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB8CE4AA0ED99C35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal